.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrlen(const char *" s ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrlen()
function computes the length of the string
.I s
by counting characters until a null terminator is reached.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters in the string, not including the terminating null byte.
.SH AUTHOR
Written by Umar (BSDSF24A050).
